{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04151","headline":"春闺 · 徐彦伯","name":"春闺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戍客戍清波，幽闺幽思多。\n暗梁闻语燕，夜烛见飞蛾。\n宝鸭藏脂粉，金屏缀绮罗。\n裁衣卷纹素，织锦度鸣梭。\n有使通西极，缄书寄北河。\n年光只恐尽，征战莫蹉跎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}